## 04_identity

This folder contains scripts for creating the identity matrix.
For creating the matrix using MMseqs2, run:

```bash
mmseqs easy-search \
    "$FASTA" \
    "$FASTA" \
    /dev/stdout \
    "$TMP" \
    --threads "$SLURM_CPUS_PER_TASK" \
    --max-seqs "$N_SEQS" \
    -s 7.5 \
    --k-score 80 \
    -e 100 \
    --min-seq-id 0 \
    --format-output "query,target,fident,alnlen,qlen,tlen" \
| awk -F'\t' '$1 < $2' \
> "$OUT"
```

Also see the SLURM script `allvsall_identity.slurm` for an example of how to run the above command on a cluster.

Then, run the `stats_identity.py` script to calculate the statistics of the identity matrix,
including the mean, median [between phylogenetic groups], and other statistics.